            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te Samueli nga azi Yehova ma milia, erini ovuria mvaru, eri su bongo mile be nyiriari i ruaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azini indi andri erini adri eri dri bongo ganaru ci, eri adri eji eri dri eli vusi eli vusi, erini emuria agupi erini be afa edeta eli vusiri ederia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eli fe asi ndriza Elikana pi dri oku erini be ra, ’yozu kini, Yehova ma fe oku ’dori dri anzi tizu mi dri, aziza erini azile Yehova ma tiarisi. Yi mu di yi vile akua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "E’do 21:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te Yehova emu Hanani andri, eri isu a, ti agupianzi na, ezoanzi iri. Te mva Samueli zo Yehova ma milia ra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
